Replace this file with your KMS root CA certificate (PEM format).

The root CA is used to pin the KMS TLS connection. It is baked into the
enclave image and affects the OS_IMAGE_HASH measurement. You can obtain
it from your KMS instance:

  curl -sk https://<kms-host>:12001/prpc/KmsService.GetTempCaCert | jq -r .caCert > app/root_ca.pem
